; Chapter 16 (낙봉파 — 방통 위기·시그니처 hidden destiny) production-tier visual scene.
; Authored per ADR-0021 §1 + §2 — mounted at /root by SceneManager.
;
; Tile rendering: chapter_visuals.gd `_draw()` overrides on the root Node2D.
; Unit silhouettes: spawned at runtime by BattleScene._spawn_unit_polygons_async.
;
; TILE_SIZE = 64. Map 14×10 — MOUNTAIN ridges top+bottom, narrow ROAD row 5,
; FOREST ambush patches rows 3+7. Hidden destiny scout_first_turns ≥ 2 → 방통 생존
; (영걸전 5대 시그니처 분기 중 1).

[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

